"""
MB · Debug badge for V2/DayOne and V2/Day30.

    python3 build-badge.py            write both app.html (+ index.html toggle)
    python3 build-badge.py --check    report what would change, write nothing
    python3 build-badge.py --strip    remove the badge from both builds

The badge = badge.css + badge-runtime.js + the tables below, written into
app.html between
    <!-- BADGE BEGIN - generated by V2/badge/build-badge.py, do not edit -->
    <!-- BADGE END -->
right before </body>. Line numbers are looked up here at build time (first
`id="<key>"` in app.html, else in js/day01.js), so re-run after any edit that
moves lines - and after every propagate, which changes Day 30's length.

Tables: key -> [code, label]. A key may be 'id.class' or 'id.class.class'
(state variants, see VARIANT). Code '?' = V2-only screen, code not yet given
by Yuan; '—' = deliberately uncoded (boot screens, orphan pages, iframes).
"""
